    "ja": "調和振動子のBAOABを、正準分布と離散Lyapunov定常分布、連続・離散の時間相関へ照合します。",
    "en": "Compare harmonic BAOAB with canonical and discrete-Lyapunov stationary distributions, and with continuous/discrete time correlations."
  },
  "caution": {
    "ja": "摩擦は実時間の相関・拡散に影響する。有限刻みでの標本化誤差は積分法と刻み幅も含めて調べる。",
    "en": "Friction changes dynamical correlations and diffusion. Finite-step sampling errors must be assessed together with the integration scheme."
  },
